  "description": {
    "text": "Champions League 2020 Aichi was held at Aichi Sky Expo on 21 December 2019. It was the first tournament to give Victory Proof, the Sword & Shield-era trophy card, in place of Victory Decoration, and the last of the 2020 season: its Kyoto and Miyagi tournaments and the Japan Championships were canceled because of COVID-19. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Proof in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
